msgid "Background colour"
msgstr "Color de fondo"

#: src/glue/lc-dialogs.c:127
msgid "Eyedropper"
msgstr "Cuentagotas"

#. The icon alone is not self-explanatory to everyone, so the name
#. * stays reachable as a tooltip regardless of which fallback was used.
#: src/glue/lc-dialogs.c:131
msgid "Pick a colour from the screen"
msgstr "Elegir un color de la pantalla"

#: src/settings/main.c:49 data/xfce4-window-button-colors-settings.desktop.in:4
msgid "Window Button Colors"
msgstr "Colores de botones de ventana"

#: src/settings/lc-settings-ui.c:139
msgid "Could not read the module autoload setting."
msgstr "No se pudo leer el ajuste de carga automática del módulo."

#: src/settings/lc-settings-ui.c:146
msgid "The /Gtk/Modules setting has an unexpected type and was left untouched."
msgstr "El ajuste /Gtk/Modules tiene un tipo inesperado y no se modificó."

#: src/settings/lc-settings-ui.c:153
msgid "Could not write the module autoload setting."
msgstr "No se pudo escribir el ajuste de carga automática del módulo."

#: src/settings/lc-settings-ui.c:209
#, c-format
msgid "Could not restart the panel: %s"
msgstr "No se pudo reiniciar el panel: %s"

#: src/settings/lc-settings-ui.c:247
msgid "Restart the panel now?"
msgstr "¿Reiniciar el panel ahora?"

#: src/settings/lc-settings-ui.c:254
msgid ""
"The panel will briefly disappear and come back. If it does not come back, "
"recover from a TTY with: xfconf-query -c xsettings -p /Gtk/Modules -r, then "
"log in again."
msgstr ""
"El panel desaparecerá brevemente y volverá. Si no vuelve, recupérelo desde "
"una TTY con: xfconf-query -c xsettings -p /Gtk/Modules -r, y vuelva a "
"iniciar sesión."

#: src/settings/lc-settings-ui.c:257
msgid "_Restart"
msgstr "_Reiniciar"

#: src/settings/lc-settings-ui.c:304
msgid "Enable window button colours"
msgstr "Activar los colores de los botones de ventana"

#: src/settings/lc-settings-ui.c:316
msgid ""
"Configuration changed since this window opened — restart the panel to apply "
"it."
msgstr ""
"La configuración cambió desde que se abrió esta ventana; reinicie el panel "
"para aplicarla."

#: src/settings/lc-settings-ui.c:321
msgid "_Restart Panel"
msgstr "_Reiniciar panel"

#: data/xfce4-window-button-colors-settings.desktop.in:5
msgid "Enable or disable per-window tasklist button colours"
msgstr ""
"Active o desactive los colores de los botones de la lista de tareas por "
"ventana"
